<title>UK: Signum sets 75 million mark June 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Signum sets 75 million mark June 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following deal was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGNUM LTD (CAYMAN SPV)</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN DEM    COUPON     9.0	 MATURITY    16.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE  S-10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD    +515 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FRFT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS NO GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT MAY 1999 BUND.</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
